## 🚀 Quickstart & Setup

### 1. Clone the Repository & Install Dependencies
```bash
git clone [https://github.com/your-username/football-transfer-classifier.git](https://github.com/your-username/football-transfer-classifier.git)
cd football-transfer-classifier
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

### 2. Run the Ingestion & Fine-Tuning Pipeline
If you want to retrain the DistilBERT model from scratch or test the synthetic data pipeline, launch the Jupyter Notebook:
```bash
jupyter notebook transfer_classifier.ipynb
```

### 3. Launch the Streamlit Web Application
Ensure your model files are saved in `./transfer_model/`, then launch the app:
```bash
streamlit run app.py
```

