## 📊 Model Performance & Inference Logic

* **Base Model:** `distilbert-base-uncased`
* **Task:** Binary Sequence Classification (`1 = Credible Journalism`, `0 = Clickbait / Rumor`)
* **Linguistic Triggers:**
  * **Credible (`1`):** *“Medical booked”*, *“Full agreement reached”*, *“Official announcement”*, *“Contract signed until...”*
  * **Clickbait (`0`):** *“MEGA SWOOP”*, *“Explosive bust-up”*, *“Plotting insane bid”*, *“Shocking report”*

